# records of 3ad7c561557ea88a
# If a helper and its callback were copied at every depth, each function of a row that hands the next one to a helper would hold all the functions behind it: N bodies of N levels
# what helpers and their callbacks add is counted at the call that the unit's own body writes. Behind three times what a callee in a loop gets, the helper is called
# RUN: walk f14 mechanisms=all
# CHECK: frame 1 callee=f1
# CHECK: frame 2 callee=f13 {{*}}parent=1
# CHECK: CallDirect {{*}} function=f1
# RUN(NEVER): walk f14 mechanisms=all
# NEVER-NOT: callee=f3 {{*}}
# RUN(ANSWERS): run-in-shell
# ANSWERS: the source prints the same

